./validate_cue_schemas_and_examples.sh
	All must pass without comments

./patch_cue.sh
	Patches the correction for recursive cue entries (like composite properties)

./cue_to_json_schema.sh
	Converts CUE to a raw JSON Schema
	Cleans the JSON Schema regarding duplications and extra fields coming from the conversion
	Verifies the JSON Schema for Draft 20/2012
	Creates examples of JSON files from cue
	Verifies these examples using the generated JSON Schema

./json_schema_to_pydantic.sh
	Prepares a Pydantic version of the JSON Schema
	Converts the JSON Schema modified to a Pydantic model (applies validation as well)
	Adds a block to Pydantic to generate incomplete Pydantic models

./generate_grammar.sh
	~Needs the ANTLR dir in the root
	Downloads the ANTLR package
	Generates the grammar from the g4 file

